<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not fully established-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not fully established-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not fully established on a live basis on Wednesday and not well established on a dressed basis, USDA said.</p>
<p>			Live basis</p>
<p>Heifers;  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1150 lbs    67.00</p>
<p>			Carcass basis:</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs 1.5 ld   107.00</p>
<p>Reported sales for Wed: 300 Week to Date:  24400</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
